2680/extras/0d0a2777271b6fd4a2beb941e13a9175.webm?t=1771381010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/0d0a2777271b6fd4a2beb941e13a9175.mp4?t=1771381010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant handcrafted world where forests, weather, and seasons shift around you. Influence the land through your actions, watch the world respond, and uncover the ancient magic that pulses beneath every stone and tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/0b67008120eb1de6a9c711aacbae20c9.webp?t=1771381010\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras_big/0b67008120eb1de6a9c711aacbae20c9.webp?t=1771381010 width=800 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/e8cd4ac11f3922a21536dc13caa75032.poster.avif?t=1771381010\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/e8cd4ac11f3922a21536dc13caa75032.webm?t=1771381010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/e8cd4ac11f3922a21536dc13caa75032.mp4?t=1771381010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Band together with up to 8 players in seamless co-op. Build unique parties, tackle challenges from different angles, and return for new adventures. Whether you forge your story alone or with friends, every journey will be your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"ht